The role-* skills in this directory are adapted from Knowledge Work Plugins
by Anthropic: https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins
Source revision: 33d3dea41a341b341d4f5da2e8801ae0c89be2b8
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0, also distributed in MindRoom's LICENSE.

These are modified, condensed role profiles, not the original plugins.
MindRoom adaptations extract responsibilities, judgment, deliverables, and
collaboration boundaries; add bilingual discovery labels; and replace
Claude-specific commands, connectors, scripts, and file conventions with
guidance for MindRoom's existing capabilities and authorization.
Each skill's metadata identifies its source plugin and source skills.
No upstream MCP configurations or executable scripts are included.

Covered source plugins: productivity, sales, customer-support,
product-management, marketing, legal, finance, data, enterprise-search,
bio-research, engineering, human-resources, design, operations, small-business.
